      "comment": "BANJO'S CLANCY (1) has a strong overall record having five wins and nine places from 17 starts including a last start second (19.73) over 352m at Q Lakeside. Goes well from this draw. Has the inside draw and looks tough to beat. OPAL ONYX (4) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing second (23.91) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 407m. Can feature again. DAYTONA BEACH (7) was out of the placings last time when sixth at this track (24.17) but did record second best time of the card when winning four back. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Should play a prominent role. BARGARA KILLIAN (5) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Hard to beat again.",
